# 统一换行：仓库内一律 LF，避免 Windows 上反复刷 CRLF 警告
* text=auto eol=lf

# 这些脚本必须是 CRLF，否则 PowerShell 5.1 / cmd 会有兼容问题
*.ps1  text eol=crlf
*.bat  text eol=crlf
*.cmd  text eol=crlf

# 二进制（不要做换行转换）
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.ico  binary
*.db   binary
*.exe  binary
*.syso binary
*.ttf  binary

# ---- GitHub 语言统计：只保留 Go ----
# Wails 模板（Java/NSIS/Obj-C/Gradle/XML…）和前端（JS/CSS/HTML）不参与语言占比，
# 否则仓库会显示成 Java。想改回来就删掉这一段。
build/**        linguist-vendored
frontend/**     linguist-vendored
*.json          linguist-vendored
*.yml           linguist-vendored
*.yaml          linguist-vendored
*.plist         linguist-vendored
*.md            linguist-documentation
*.java          linguist-vendored
*.gradle        linguist-vendored
*.xml           linguist-vendored
*.nsi           linguist-vendored
*.nsh           linguist-vendored
*.m             linguist-vendored
*.h             linguist-vendored
*.pbxproj       linguist-vendored
*.storyboard    linguist-vendored
*.sh            linguist-vendored
*.css           linguist-vendored
